# Read by ripgrep-family tools, including straitjacket. Not a .gitignore —
# these paths ARE committed; they are simply not ours to lint.
#
# The vendored renderer (@pierre/diffs, Apache-2.0) is minified third-party
# output. Linting it reports 800+ findings about code nobody here wrote and
# nobody here can fix, which is noise that hides the real ones.
immersion/vendor/
